            <ArticleTitle>The synthesis of 15N(7)-Hoogsteen face-labeled adenosine phosphoramidite for solid-phase RNA synthesis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>149-155</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00706-016-1882-8</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="ABSTRACT" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">We have developed an efficient route for the synthesis of 15N(7)-labeled adenosine as phosphoramidite building block for site- and atom-specific incorporation into RNA by automated solid-phase synthesis. Such labeled RNA is required for the evaluation of selected non-canonical base pair interactions in folded RNA using NMR spectroscopic methods.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="GRAPHICAL ABSTRACT" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED"/>
            </Abstract>
